.TH GIT-FWT 1 "September 2026" "fwt 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
git-fwt \- fast sparse worktrees for large Bazel monorepos
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fwt
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B git fwt
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fwt
creates sparse Git worktrees without materializing an entire large repository.
It also manages full worktrees, macOS APFS copy-on-write clones, structured cone
profiles, and the local checkout registry.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BI "fwt new " branch
Create a sparse worktree using FWT_CONE_DEFAULT (or the default profile).
.TP
.BI "fwt new " branch " --cone " name
Create a sparse worktree using the named cone profile.
.TP
.BI "fwt new " branch " --full"
Create a normal full Git worktree.
.TP
.BI "fwt new " branch " --cow"
Create a full copy-on-write clone. This requires macOS, APFS, and source and
destination paths on the same volume.
.TP
.B "fwt ls [--json]"
List real Git worktrees and registered or discovered COW clones in one view.
.TP
.BI "fwt cd " branch
Print the checkout path. When the supplied shell shim is loaded, change the
parent shell to that path.
.TP
.BI "fwt rm " branch
Remove a linked worktree or move a COW clone to the user's Trash.
.TP
.B "fwt cone ls [--json]"
List cone profiles with their size, provenance, and staleness state.
.TP
.BI "fwt cone set " name " [--description " text "] " dir ...
Write a manual YAML cone profile.
.TP
.BI "fwt cone derive " name " " bazel-target " [--description " text "]"
Run a Bazel query from the full checkout and write a derived YAML cone profile.
.TP
.B "fwt tune"
Apply the documented Git settings, rewrite the index as version 4, write the
commit graph, and start incremental maintenance.
.TP
.B "fwt skill install --agent claude-code"
Install or refresh the coding-agent skill embedded in this version of fwt.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B FWT_BASE
Checkout directory. Default: ~/worktrees.
.TP
.B FWT_CONE_DIR
Repository-keyed cone directory. Default: ~/.config/fwt/cones.
.TP
.B FWT_CONE_DEFAULT
Default cone profile name. Default: default.
.TP
.B FWT_SEED
Whitespace-, comma-, or colon-separated relative paths copied from the main
checkout into a fresh worktree.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/fwt/cones/<repo>/<profile>.yaml
Structured cone profiles. Legacy extensionless flat profiles are migrated on
first read.
.TP
.I ~/.config/fwt/clones.json
Locked, atomically updated COW clone registry.
.TP
.I ~/.claude/skills/fwt/SKILL.md
Claude Code skill written by
.BR "fwt skill install" .
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 for success, 1 for usage, validation, configuration, or local I/O errors,
and 2 when an underlying Git or Bazel operation fails.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR git-worktree (1),
.BR git-sparse-checkout (1),
.BR bazel (1)
